{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-39","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational : and let it be called major.","book":10,"number":39,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.39","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.39/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":39,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","contentId":"euclid-10-39","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6787d9ce6145be164d73c85611c4320e51ef317c6512e3b6627d7a6c35091481","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-39.statement","euclid-10-39.construction.1","euclid-10-39.proof.1","euclid-10-39.proof.2","euclid-10-39.conclusion","euclid-10-39.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-39.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fbc2880687688a6b6d01b7f83e06e9ee665d75a221edbe266ade62f2fb6851b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational : and let it be called major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将正方形的正方形直线不可公度加在一起,有理直线加在一起,中项无理线段直线加在一起,则整条直线为无理:让它被称为大线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-39.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ad689ee187f90ed6cf3f74f42a8daac13b92c13a99f262dab774cb9f0ff55c2","citations":["euclid-10-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two straight lines AB, BC incommensurable in square, and fulfilling the given conditions [[X. 33](/principles/euclid-10-33) ], be added together; I say that AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将两条AB线,BC 不可公度线加在一起,满足特定条件;我说AC线是无理。 [ [X. 33](/principles/euclid-10-33)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-39.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccdf0ac383f370f439378719e9664ec491808c2364aead10a8af0965d77ad223","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the rectangle AB, BC is medial, twice the rectangle AB, BC is also medial. [[X. 6 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,矩形 AB,BC是中项无理线段,是矩形 AB的两倍,BC也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 6 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-39.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48b4b4f6a4eb50f996df98696f0b610947c2da58abbacd5e9681ff071f795e03","citations":["euclid-10-16","euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of the squares on AB, BC is rational; therefore twice the rectangle AB, BC is incommensurable with the sum of the squares on AB, BC, so that the squares on AB, BC together with twice the rectangle AB, BC that is, the square on AC, is also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on AB, BC; [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16) ] therefore the square on AC is irrational, so that AC is also irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB,BC的正方形和正方形之和是有理;因此,矩形,AB,BC的两倍是不可公度,BC和正方形之和是AB,BC,加矩形之和是矩形,AC之和的两倍,AC的正方形加不可公度,AC之和是不可公度,BC之和是不可公度,AB之和。]因此,AC的正方形加无理,AC加无理 [ [ [X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16) [X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-39.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc9ba0bbe281dc0e14d01527fa3504a77832fc9b0631ed743e693bf1f3f810c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called major. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。,请称它为少校"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-39.source","contentId":"euclid-10-39","revisionId":"euclid-10-39@raw-6787d9ce6145be16","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cc6a06bf4c734efc7228bbb557b994316c3aef1780f86b8e4d77157ab906780","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.39/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.39\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/lic